@baseUrl = https://localhost:5005
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@id = REPLACE_WITH_PODCAST_ID

### Prepare a private emission (api scope; start/stop remain manual)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/planned
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Concert prepare","scheduledStartAt":"2026-12-01T20:00:00+01:00","plannedDurationMinutes":90}

### Edit before start and publish a public presentation; null/empty announcement unpublishes it
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}/planned
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Concert prepare","scheduledStartAt":"2026-12-01T20:00:00+01:00","plannedDurationMinutes":90,"publicAnnouncement":"Venez ecouter notre concert"}

### Public presentation only (no token, no stream)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/announcements

### Start the prepared emission manually, retaining its identifier (owner only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a live broadcast
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Concert en direct"}

### List live broadcasts and replays
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read committed metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload the first complete MPEG-TS segment (file produced by LibVLC)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}/segments/0?duration=4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: video/mp2t

< ./segment.ts

### Play the HLS event playlist (send Authorization on segment requests too)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}/index.m3u8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read a committed segment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}/segments/0.ts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Finish and retain the replay
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ready MP4: authenticated seek range (206; 409 until replay.state is Ready)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}/replay.mp4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Range: bytes=0-65535

### MP4 size and range support without downloading the body
HEAD {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}/replay.mp4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Retry failed MP4 preparation (owner only; 202)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}/replay/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete an ended podcast (owner only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown podcast: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### OpenAPI in development (requires an Administrator token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/podcasts.json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### Activate OBS for an owned planned podcast (secret SRT ServerUrl; StreamKey is empty)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}/obs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### OBS activation status (never returns the stream key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}/obs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke OBS and disconnect its publisher (allowed at consumption limit)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/podcasts/{{id}}/obs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Activation: 403 other owner/closed account, 404 missing emission,
# 409 already started, 413 disk full, 429 consumption limit,
# 503 OBS disabled, FFmpeg unavailable or listener/UDP port capacity reached.
